  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "The Additional Custom Field module in eCommerceGo SAAS empowers businesses to enrich their products with customized fields, enabling them to gather precise and relevant information. This module is particularly beneficial for industries such as spas, clinics, or other appointment-based services where capturing detailed client information is essential. By leveraging this feature, admins can create tailored data fields that enhance the overall product configuration and booking experience, ensuring that the collected information aligns with their specific business needs": "Det ekstra Custom Field-modul i eCommerceGo SAAS giver virksomheder mulighed for at berige deres produkter med tilpassede felter, så de kan indsamle præcise og relevante oplysninger. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Se Live Demo",
  "Enabling the Additional Custom Field Feature": "Aktivering af den ekstra brugerdefinerede feltfunktion",
  "Before utilizing the Additional Custom Field module, administrators must enable its functionality within the eCommerceGo SAAS settings. This critical step unlocks the module's tools, allowing admins to define and add custom fields. Activation is simple: navigate to the settings menu, locate the Additional Custom Field toggle, and switch it on. Once enabled, admins can customize fields for each product, paving the way for more detailed information capture during product creation and configuration.": "Før du bruger modulet Ekstra tilpasset felt, skal administratorer aktivere dets funktionalitet i eCommerceGo SAAS-indstillingerne. ",
  "Adding Custom Fields for Products": "Tilføjelse af brugerdefinerede felter til produkter",
  "With the feature activated, administrators can introduce custom fields while creating or editing a product. These fields allow for capturing specific data that might be unique to a business's operation, such as client preferences, additional instructions, or service-specific details. Custom fields can include text inputs, dropdown menus, or checkboxes, offering flexibility in data collection. Once defined during product creation, these fields become an integral part of the product details and ensure that all necessary information is gathered upfront.": "Med funktionen aktiveret kan administratorer indføre brugerdefinerede felter, mens de opretter eller redigerer et produkt. ",
  "Enhancing Product Details with Custom Fields": "Forbedring af produktdetaljer med brugerdefinerede felter",
  "The Additional Custom Field module is designed to optimize the administrative process of product configuration. By allowing admins to input additional field values during product creation, the module ensures that relevant details are automatically included in the Additional Custom Field page. This centralized repository of information reduces manual data entry and ensures consistency across records. The enhanced product details streamline internal workflows and improve communication between admins and their customers.": "Modulet Ekstra brugerdefineret felt er designet til at optimere den administrative proces for produktkonfiguration. ",
  "Benefits of Streamlined Data Collection": "Fordele ved strømlinet dataindsamling",
  "The Additional Custom Field module simplifies data collection, reducing errors and the need for follow-up inquiries. By embedding custom fields directly into product creation, businesses can ensure that critical information is captured early in the process. This feature supports a smoother, more efficient workflow, enabling better customer service and operational excellence": "Ekstra Custom Field-modulet forenkler dataindsamlingen, reducerer fejl og behovet for opfølgende forespørgsler. ",
